
/* The EmpoweredHouse design system, this application's default look (ehos_app): its tokens, their
   Tailwind utilities (bg-surface-1, text-fg-secondary, border-line-faint, …), one daisyUI theme
   made of them, and its fonts, which the endpoint serves. Override a token at the end of this
   file. For a look of your own, remove this import, turn daisyUI's themes back on, and remove the
   endpoint's Plug.Static for ehos_design. */
@import "<%= @design_system_css %>";
